sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App as Hawk app (phone)
  participant Idx as Local index (phone)
  participant Emb as embed_texts
  participant Ask as ask function
  participant DB as Firestore
  participant LLM as Gemini Flash-Lite
  U->>App: What was the deposit amount?
  App->>App: understandLocally() — dates, type, filler
  App->>Emb: question text
  Emb-->>App: query vector (nothing stored)
  App->>Idx: KNN 60 + lexical rescore + RRF
  Idx-->>App: top passage IDs + distances
  App->>Ask: question + passage IDs (never text)
  Ask->>DB: reserve an answer slot (transaction)
  Ask->>DB: read the chunks by ID
  Note over Ask,DB: drops other users', dormant and missing chunks
  Ask->>LLM: question + numbered sources
  LLM-->>Ask: JSON blocks + citation numbers
  Ask->>Ask: validate citations, derive confidence
  alt nothing cited, or an error
    Ask->>DB: release the slot
  end
  Ask->>DB: save the message (server-only)
  Ask-->>App: answer blocks + citations + confidence
  App-->>U: answer with tappable sources
